Priya: Sample code for backoff I'll include (JS snippet):
```javascript
// exponential backoff + jitter
async function callWithRetry(payload){
  let attempt=0;
  while(attempt<5){
    try{
      return await fetch('/v1/generate',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify(payload)});
    }catch(e){
      const wait = Math.pow(2,attempt)*100 + Math.floor(Math.random()*100);
      await new Promise(r=>setTimeout(r,wait));
      attempt++;
    }
  }
  throw new Error('max retries exceeded');
}
```
